# ANCHORED, unlike the two above, because "artifacts" names two different
# things: the generated output directory at the repo root, and a source
# directory inside a package. A bare entry matches a path segment at ANY depth,
# so it was silently excluding packages/execution-engine/src/artifacts/ as well.
#
# "node_modules" and "dist" stay bare on purpose — those DO occur at every depth
# (packages/*/dist), and anchoring them would be the opposite mistake.
